# The image build context is the repository root; only the files the
# Dockerfile copies in belong in it.
.git
.gitignore
.github
README.md
LICENSE
docs
build
apparmor
net-policies
src
tests
target
Cargo.toml
Cargo.lock
*.swp
*~
# Generated box state, never build input. The vm runtime's Docker store lives
# here as a sparse image that is ~500 GB *apparent*: the classic builder writes
# a context file's full logical size, so without this line a build started from
# a project directory that has run a vm box stalls or fills the disk.
vms_and_docker_from_llm_box
# Release artifacts checked out next to the source (14 MB, never COPYed).
*.deb
